;; PROOF A-E at machine precision. (A second candidate, jakf-hd = jak3 ljkfeet jakc-feet "barefoot",
;; was integrated in the same cycle and REMOVED COMPLETELY on the owner's 19:30 verdict — buggy and
;; useless. Do not re-add it.)
